<section class="section">
  <h2>Projects</h2>
  <article class="proj">
    <div class="head">
      <h3>Sigmise</h3>
      <a href="https://sigmise.com">sigmise.com</a>
    </div>
    <p class="sub">Solo founder · cross-platform AI meeting copilot for live transcription, translation, and notes.</p>
    <ul class="points">
      <li>Owned the full vertical — Electron + React desktop client (Windows/macOS, signed &amp; notarised), Node.js backend, Next.js marketing site, and a self-hosted Prometheus + Grafana observability stack with Telegram alerting.</li>
      <li>Real-time audio pipeline — low-latency WebSocket capture (system audio + mic separately), streamed to Azure Speech / Deepgram for diarized transcription, with rolling-context live summaries.</li>
      <li>Local-first sync — SQLite client, PostgreSQL + Drizzle server, lazy R2 file downloads, last-writer-wins conflict resolution. Full offline functionality.</li>
      <li>Production AI integration — Gemini via OpenRouter (Vercel AI SDK) for post-meeting summaries, streaming chat over notes, and rolling live summaries; same provider drop-in for translation.</li>
      <li>Delivery &amp; observability — GitHub Actions → GHCR → Coolify with lint/typecheck gating; signed installers and electron-updater channel with force-update support.</li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</section>

